# Project context

This workspace is **sempatpanick** (Roblox executor hub). The folder name `cobalt` is local only.

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/README.md` before non-trivial changes. Details live in `docs/knowledge/`, `docs/style/`, and `docs/prd/product.md`.

- Do not edit `Cobalt.luau`.
- New games: `games/sempat/`, register PlaceId in **both** `sempatpanick.lua` and `sempatpanick_local.lua`.
- Dual-load modules (`require` then `HttpGet`); use `shared.sempatpanick_baseURL`; strip BOM.
- Shared tabs: `tabs/rayfield/*`. WindUI only wraps them.
- Match existing file style. Do not mass-reformat.
- Commits: Conventional Commits (`docs/style/commits.md`), and only when asked.
